            "**Required.** Write and speak an introduction for a fictional character with a name, role, and country or city. Make a second version by changing all three details while preserving the constructions.\n\n**Transfer check.** A partner names one new safe role. Find a verified form in a dictionary, explain its ending, and use it in an exchange without reading.",
